		<title>Madonna denies rumors that she wants to buy one of the Palladian Villas of the Veneto in the surround area of Vicenza</title>
		<link rel="alternate" type="text/html" href="http://drownedmadonna.com/index/item/41-madonna-denies-rumors-that-she-wants-to-buy-one-of-the-palladian-villas-of-the-veneto-in-the-surround-area-of-vicenza.html"/>
		<published>2011-09-05T23:23:33Z</published>
		<updated>2011-09-05T23:23:33Z</updated>
		<id>http://drownedmadonna.com/index/item/41-madonna-denies-rumors-that-she-wants-to-buy-one-of-the-palladian-villas-of-the-veneto-in-the-surround-area-of-vicenza.html</id>
		<author>
			<name>Giampiero Fiorelli</name>
		</author>
		<summary type="html">&lt;div class=&quot;K2FeedIntroText&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;When &lt;strong&gt;Madonna&lt;/strong&gt; was about to arrive in &lt;strong&gt;Venice&lt;/strong&gt; to premiere her movie &lt;strong&gt;W.E&lt;/strong&gt;. at the Film Festival 2011, Italian press started to report that the diva wanted to buy one of the &lt;strong&gt;Palladian Villas of the Veneto&lt;/strong&gt; on the surrounding of &lt;strong&gt;Vicenza&lt;/strong&gt;, Italy. These villas, designed by Italian architect Andrea Palladio, are inscribed on UNESCO World Heritage List since 1994.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;But, talking with &lt;strong&gt;WWD&lt;/strong&gt;, &lt;strong&gt;Madonna&lt;/strong&gt; said that these rumours are &quot;not true.&quot;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&quot;Every time I go somewhere, they say that, but enough houses,” she added.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This is not the first time &lt;strong&gt;Madonna&lt;/strong&gt; is reportedly looking for a villa in &lt;strong&gt;Italy&lt;/strong&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;When &lt;strong&gt;Madonna&lt;/strong&gt; was last months pregnant of &lt;strong&gt;Rocco&lt;/strong&gt;, she spent a few weeks in &lt;strong&gt;Italy&lt;/strong&gt;. First she went to &lt;strong&gt;Pantelleria Island&lt;/strong&gt;, South of Italy, as a guest of Italian photographer &lt;strong&gt;Fabrizio Ferri&lt;/strong&gt;, who took some intimate pictures of the pregnant star. Then she moved in &lt;strong&gt;Tuscany&lt;/strong&gt; at &lt;strong&gt;Sting&lt;/strong&gt; country-house. Finally, in all secrecy, she rented a car and drove to &lt;strong&gt;Umbria&lt;/strong&gt;, Central Italy. She went to the &lt;strong&gt;Massa Martana&lt;/strong&gt; country-side. Paparazzi got the scoop when she was already there. Reportedly she booked the country-side of Italian celebrity &lt;strong&gt;Marina Ripa di Meana&lt;/strong&gt;, who was one of the guest stars on the &lt;strong&gt;W.E.&lt;/strong&gt; red carpet in Venice. According to &lt;strong&gt;Marina Ripa di Meana&lt;/strong&gt;, &lt;strong&gt;Madonna&lt;/strong&gt; booked her house under an alias, and, when she was staying there, she expressed the wish to buy it, since she was looking for a villa in &lt;strong&gt;Umbria&lt;/strong&gt; or &lt;strong&gt;Tuscany&lt;/strong&gt;. But &lt;strong&gt;Marina&lt;/strong&gt; requested &lt;strong&gt;Madonna&lt;/strong&gt; to do a free concert in &lt;strong&gt;Umbria&lt;/strong&gt;, to promote her &lt;strong&gt;battle against fur coats&lt;/strong&gt;, as a clause. At the end, as known, there was any concert in &lt;strong&gt;Umbria&lt;/strong&gt; neither &lt;strong&gt;Madonna&lt;/strong&gt; bought &lt;strong&gt;Marina Ripa di Meana&lt;/strong&gt; country-house in &lt;strong&gt;Massa Martana&lt;/strong&gt; surrounding.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;</summary>
		<content type="html">&lt;div class=&quot;K2FeedIntroText&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;When &lt;strong&gt;Madonna&lt;/strong&gt; was about to arrive in &lt;strong&gt;Venice&lt;/strong&gt; to premiere her movie &lt;strong&gt;W.E&lt;/strong&gt;. at the Film Festival 2011, Italian press started to report that the diva wanted to buy one of the &lt;strong&gt;Palladian Villas of the Veneto&lt;/strong&gt; on the surrounding of &lt;strong&gt;Vicenza&lt;/strong&gt;, Italy. These villas, designed by Italian architect Andrea Palladio, are inscribed on UNESCO World Heritage List since 1994.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;But, talking with &lt;strong&gt;WWD&lt;/strong&gt;, &lt;strong&gt;Madonna&lt;/strong&gt; said that these rumours are &quot;not true.&quot;&lt;/p&gt;
