	<entry>
		<title>Madonna is in New York City</title>
		<link rel="alternate" type="text/html" href="http://drownedmadonna.com/index/item/40-madonna-is-in-new-york-city.html"/>
		<published>2011-09-05T17:26:40Z</published>
		<updated>2011-09-05T17:26:40Z</updated>
		<id>http://drownedmadonna.com/index/item/40-madonna-is-in-new-york-city.html</id>
		<author>
			<name>Giampiero Fiorelli</name>
		</author>
		<summary type="html">&lt;div class=&quot;K2FeedIntroText&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Madonna&lt;/strong&gt;'s stay in &lt;strong&gt;London&lt;/strong&gt; lasted just the time to take a connecting flight from &lt;strong&gt;London&lt;/strong&gt;'s &lt;strong&gt;Heathrow Airport&lt;/strong&gt; to &lt;strong&gt;JFK Airport&lt;/strong&gt; in &lt;strong&gt;New York City&lt;/strong&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Her Madgesty&lt;/strong&gt; was with her children &lt;strong&gt;Lourdes&lt;/strong&gt;, &lt;strong&gt;Rocco&lt;/strong&gt;, &lt;strong&gt;David&lt;/strong&gt;, and &lt;strong&gt;Mercy&lt;/strong&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;In the &lt;a href=&quot;http://drownedmadonna.com/index/item/29-madonna-reveals-the-release-dates-for-her-new-single-and-her-upcoming-album.html&quot; target=&quot;_self&quot; title=&quot;Interview with Swedish SVT Television&quot;&gt;now-famous interview&lt;/a&gt; with &lt;strong&gt;Swedish SVT Television&lt;/strong&gt;, where &lt;strong&gt;Madonna&lt;/strong&gt; revealed the release dates for her new single and upcoming album, she also confessed that &quot;when I go back to New York, till the end of the year I'll be in the recording studio.&quot;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;But &lt;strong&gt;Madonna&lt;/strong&gt; has to take a break soon for the premiere of &lt;strong&gt;W.E.&lt;/strong&gt; at the &lt;strong&gt;Toronto International Film Festival 2011&lt;/strong&gt;, where her red carpet is planned for &lt;strong&gt;September 12&lt;/strong&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Another already planned break is on &lt;strong&gt;November 12&lt;/strong&gt; for the &lt;strong&gt;Smirnoff Nightlife Exchange Project&lt;/strong&gt;, a cool social media marketing strategy to discover a dancer for &lt;strong&gt;Madonna's new tour&lt;/strong&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;img src=&quot;http://drownedmadonna.com/img/2011/madonna-we-pendant.jpg&quot; border=&quot;0&quot; alt=&quot;Madonna wearing a W.E. pendant&quot; width=&quot;790&quot; height=&quot;395&quot; style=&quot;border: 0;&quot; /&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
